  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "In 2023, Humanities Magazine published an article, \"Red Map, Blue Map,\" about political geographer Kenneth C. Martis and his work mapping every congressional district, color-coded by party from the first Congress onward.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384017607:69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Published in 1989, The Historical Atlas of Political Parties in the United States Congress: 1789-1989 was the first to map all U.S. congressional elections by state and district and by party.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384017607:70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Since the 2000 United States presidential election, \"red state\" has referred to states that predominantly vote Republican, and \"blue state\" to states that predominantly vote Democratic.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384017607:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "On 5 November 2026, 69,411 people read the article, about 33× the usual.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Red_states_and_blue_states:2026-11-05",
        "views:en:Red_states_and_blue_states:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:32Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, German was highest with 1,602 readers.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Red_states_and_blue_states:2026-11-05",
        "views:de:Rote_Staaten_und_blaue_Staaten:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:39Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers; a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:de:Rote_Staaten_und_blaue_Staaten:2026-11-05",
        "views:es:Estados_rojos_y_estados_azules:2026-11-05",
        "views:zh:紅州與藍州:2026-11-05",
        "views:ja:赤い州・青い州:2026-11-05",
        "views:fr:États_rouges_et_États_bleus:2026-11-05",
        "views:fa:ایالت‌های_آبی_و_ایالت‌های_قرمز:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:49Z",
      "text": "The sources are Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews and Wikidata, and every caption links to the evidence it rests on.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384017607:69",
        "views:en:Red_states_and_blue_states:2026-11-05",
        "wd:Q1190344:P31"
      ]
    }
  ],
